        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Niels de Ruiter\n- Songs: \"Enter Sandman\"\n- Bands: Metallica\n- Albums: \"Metallica\"\n\nFacts:\n- In 1991, Metallica released \"Enter Sandman\" as the first single from their fifth album, \"Metallica.\"\n- Niels de Ruiter is known for using Metallica's \"Enter Sandman\" as his walk-on music.\n- Niels de Ruiter plays air guitar while entering the stage to \"Enter Sandman.\"",
